Mergesort performance comparison between hotspots in c and assembly.

Made by Jens Christian Valen Leynse and Jørgen Angelo Lyngstad



Navigate to the folder where all the files are

To compile:
Type: make

To run the program:
Type: ./program 


If you want to profile:

After compiling and running it once:
Type: gprof program gmon.out >data.txt

